==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Jack Hammer (Enemy)|Jack Hammer]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A stage that might seem difficult due to Jack Hammer's immense range, none of the units here are actually threatening. You can stall really easily, due to the lack of pushing power, and slowly grind out his health.

